## The problem

Planning missions for more than one drone means juggling routes, spacing and airspace rules at the same time. Most hobby tools assume a single aircraft.

## What I built

A planning and modelling playground for multi-drone routes. It is built for Canada, with compliance with Canadian drone rules treated as a design constraint rather than an afterthought.

